{"id":"freno","lemma":"freno","pos":"noun","rank":3998,"glosses":["brake (device used to slow or stop the motion of a wheel or vehicle)","bit (piece of metal placed in a horse's mouth and connected to the reins to direct the animal)","check, restraint (control, limit, or stop)"],"ipa":"/ˈfɾeno/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"frenos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/80/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-freno.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ajusta los frenos.","en":"Adjust the brakes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636869","words":[{"g":"to adjust, to set","l":"ajustar"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"El freno dejó de funcionar.","en":"The brake stopped working.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77885","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to leave","l":"dejar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to work, to function"}]},{"text":"Algo anda mal con los frenos.","en":"Something is wrong with the brakes.","words":[{"g":"something, anything"},{"g":"interjection to express…"},{"g":"badly, poorly, ill"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"¡No tenemos frenos!","en":"We've got no brakes!","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null]},{"text":"No funcionaban los frenos.","en":"The brake didn't work.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460106","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to work, to function","l":"funcionar"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}